# Conventions: p1 = first seat, p2 = second seat, both scripted; see interaction-tests/README.md.

=== bilbo-does-not-discount-spells-cast-from-hand
title: Bilbo's reduction applies only to spells cast from outside the hand; Kaito ({2}{U}{B}) cannot be cast from hand with three mana sources
ref: Bilbo, Thief in the Night Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Bilbo, Thief in the Night;Underground Sea;Underground Sea;Undercity Sewers
  humanhand=Kaito, Bane of Nightmares
script:
  p1: try cast Kaito, Bane of Nightmares
expect:
  not controls p1 "Kaito, Bane of Nightmares"
